      "writtenOn": "2019-08-19T22:10:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Making GPIO10 a pullup makes jacuzzi not boot since it\u0027s touching PMIC_FORCE_RESET.\n\n0x80 is fine, but 0x01 is not.\n\n\nAnd again, why do we want to pullup in the first place anyway? I would just leave this 0.",
